# Drumming Workshops Bassidi Kone's 'RHYTHMS OF MALI'

![Drumming Workshops](/media/2013/06/Bassidi-Kone-flyer.jpg) Drumming Worksops for all levels returns to the Sunshine Coast with Bassidi Kone from Mali. World class musician, Bassidi Kone is a supportive, warm and patient teacher with a positive energy, infectious smile and exceptional knowledge of Mali's cultural music and heritage. Learn traditional djembe and dundun parts for rhythms of MALI. Be sure not to miss this event and keep posted for more information. Book Now!

## African Drumming Workshops @ BEMAC Brisbane

Level 1, 102 Main Street, Kangaroo Point, Qld **Drumming Workshop 1** 12.30PM- 2PM **Drumming Workshop 2** 2.30PM-4PM Email: info@rhythmculture.com.au Ph:0434585992 [www.rhythmculture.com.au](/) Sunday July 14th BEMAC, Brisbane 12.30-4pm Bookings Essential
